    <string name="dsh_ack_dsha">DSHA — container bootstrap, wireless ADB pairing, PTY terminal (MIT, qiannianhuanxiang)</string>
    <string name="dsh_ack_dshm">DSHM — online runtime delivery and mirror racing (GPL-3.0)</string>
    <string name="dsh_ack_folkpatch">FolkPatch — the Compose UI and theme system this app is built on (GPL-3.0, LyraVoid / matsuzaka-yuki)</string>
    <string name="dsh_ack_termux">Termux terminal-view / terminal-emulator — the PTY and terminal emulation (Apache-2.0)</string>

